hiding things?

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:30.039
And the only thing they hid was the transcript
with the Ukrainian president.

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:32.250
Of course they're using it for other things.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:37.060
And there are new reports which say that the
